#. advancedGaokaoQuestions.mathematics.3.LU-M01.3
#: src/data/gaokao-advanced.js:148
msgctxt "text:advancedGaokaoQuestions.mathematics.3.LU-M01.3"
msgid ""
"Nodes: G gate, W wind stop, B hall, K workshop.\nEdges (min): G–W walk 6; W–K "
"wind 12; G–B walk 9; B–K rabbit 10; G–K walk 31.\nAt full moon W–K is closed. "
"Rabbit shuttles leave B every 15 minutes from 08:00. After reaching B, the "
"candidate must complete a 3-minute check before boarding; if a service has "
"departed by completion, the next one must be used. The candidate reaches G "
"at 08:08."
msgstr ""
"Nodes: G gate, W wind stop, B hall, K workshop.\nEdges (min): G–W walk 6; W–K "
"wind 12; G–B walk 9; B–K rabbit 10; G–K walk 31.\nAt full moon W–K is closed. "
"Rabbit shuttles leave B every 15 minutes from 08:00. After reaching B, the "
"candidate must complete a 3-minute check before boarding; if a service has "
"departed by completion, the next one must be used. The candidate reaches G "
"at 08:08."

#. advancedGaokaoQuestions.mathematics.3.LU-M01.4
#: src/data/gaokao-advanced.js:149
msgctxt "text:advancedGaokaoQuestions.mathematics.3.LU-M01.4"
